    20→ *          if all are "stop-And-Remain"                                → RED
    21→ *   Time : pick the smallest non-null *PdsgRmdrCs ÷ 10 (seconds) when RED,
    22→ *          or the largest non-null *PdsgRmdrCs ÷ 10 when GREEN (longest cross time).
